  "articleBody": "You might be wondering if you can tackle a toilet grab bar installation yourself, and sometimes you absolutely can! But there are definitely situations where bringing in a professional like HH Remodeling LLC makes a lot of sense. For instance, if you can’t easily find studs where you need the bar to go, that’s a big signal. You need solid structural support, not just drywall. Another time to call us is if you’ve got tile or other hard finishes on your walls that need to be drilled into. That’s not a job for just any drill, and a professional has the right tools and know-how to do it without cracking your tile. Maybe you or a family member have unique mobility needs that require a custom layout for the grab bar, or you need to ensure it meets specific accessibility guidelines and can safely support at least 250 lbs. We can help with that too, making sure the placement is just right and the installation is super secure. Don't risk an improper installation that could lead to an accident; get the peace of mind that comes with expert help.",
  "datePublished": "2026-08-09"
}